sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant View as Django note_create view
    participant Form as NoteForm
    participant Model as Note model / ORM
    participant DB as SQLite database

    User->>Browser: Enter note and submit
    Browser->>View: POST /notes/new/
    View->>Form: Validate submitted data
    Form-->>View: Return validation result
    alt Form is valid
        View->>Model: Save note
        Model->>DB: INSERT note
        DB-->>Model: Saved record
        Model-->>View: Note instance
        View-->>Browser: Redirect to note detail
        Browser->>View: GET /notes/{id}/
        View->>Model: Fetch note by primary key
        Model->>DB: SELECT note
        DB-->>Model: Note record
        Model-->>View: Note instance
        View-->>Browser: Render detail page
    else Form is invalid
        View-->>Browser: Re-render form with errors
    end
